{"id":"convosco","lemma":"convosco","pos":"adv","rank":1152,"glosses":["with you (plural)"],"ipa":"/kõˈvoʃ.ku/","examples":[{"text":"Vamos começar convosco.","en":"Let's start with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/844117","words":[{"g":"let's go"},{"g":"to start"},null]},{"text":"Poderíamos falar convosco?","en":"Could we speak to you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/844244","words":[{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to speak"},null]},{"text":"Tom não vai convosco.","en":"Tom won't go with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/887646","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null]},{"text":"Falo convosco depois.","en":"I'll talk to you later.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/844311","words":[{"g":"to speak","l":"falar"},null,{"g":"later"}]},{"text":"Todos concordam convosco.","en":"Everybody agrees with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/844342","words":[{"g":"everyone"},{"g":"to agree","l":"concordar"},null]}]}